{# Shared brand block, included by content prompts. Not a standalone prompt (no front matter). #}
## The business
- Name: {{ business_name }}
- Industry: {{ industry }} — emphasise {{ industry_focus }}.
{% if description %}- What they sell: {{ description }}
{% endif %}{% if audience %}- Audience: {{ audience }}
{% endif %}{% if locations %}- Location: {{ locations | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}{% if website %}- Website: {{ website }}
{% endif %}
## Brand voice
{% if voice_profile %}- {{ voice_profile.summary }}
- Tone: {{ voice_profile.tone_adjectives | join(", ") }}; formality {{ voice_profile.formality }}/5; {{ voice_profile.sentence_length }} sentences; emoji: {{ voice_profile.emoji_usage }}.
{% if voice_profile.signature_phrases %}- Signature phrases (use sparingly): {{ voice_profile.signature_phrases | join(" | ") }}
{% endif %}{% elif voice_tone %}- {{ voice_tone }}
{% else %}- No voice defined yet: write warmly and plainly, like a local business owner.
{% endif %}{% if do_words %}- Words they use: {{ do_words | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}{% if dont_words %}- NEVER use: {{ dont_words | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}{% if sample_posts %}
Past posts that sound like them:
{% for p in sample_posts %}> {{ p | replace("\n", " ") }}
{% endfor %}{% endif %}
{% if industry_avoid %}## Compliance
- {{ industry_avoid }}
{% endif %}
## Facts from the brand's own documents
{% if knowledge %}Only use facts from here (cite nothing in the output; just don't contradict or embellish):
{% for k in knowledge %}[{{ k.n }}] ({{ k.source }}{% if k.heading %} › {{ k.heading }}{% endif %}) {{ k.text | replace("\n", " ") }}
{% endfor %}{% else %}None provided. Do NOT invent prices, dates, addresses, menu items, offers or statistics — keep claims general.
{% endif %}
